        "_brand_page": {
          "version": 3,
          "body": "<style>\n* {box-sizing: border-box;margin: 0;padding: 0}\nbody {background-color: #F8F5F2;color: #4A1525;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6}\nheader {background-color: #691425;color: #F8F5F2;padding: 4rem 2rem 6rem 2rem;text-align: center}\n.hero-band {background-color: #4A1525;color: #F8F5F2;padding: 3rem 2rem;margin-top: -3rem;max-width: 900px;margin-left: auto;margin-right: auto;border-radius: 4px}\n.hero-band h1 {font-size: 3.5rem;letter-spacing: 0.1em;margin-bottom: 1rem}\n.hero-band p {font-size: 1.1rem;color: #D3B8B8;max-width: 600px;margin: 0 auto}\n.hero-links {margin-top: 2rem}\n.hero-links a {color: #F8F5F2;text-decoration: underline;margin: 0 1rem;font-weight: bold}\nmain {max-width: 1000px;margin: 0 auto;padding: 3rem 1.5rem}\nsection {margin-bottom: 4rem}\nh2 {font-size: 2rem;color: #691425;margin-bottom: 1.5rem;border-bottom: 2px solid #691425;padding-bottom: 0.5rem}\nh3 {font-size: 1.25rem;color: #4A1525;margin-bottom: 0.75rem}\n.grid-steps {display: grid;grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));gap: 1.5rem}\n.ticket-card {border: 2px dashed #691425;padding: 2rem;background-color: #FFFFFF}\n.ticket-card.featured {border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;background-color: #FDFBF7}\n.price {font-size: 1.75rem;font-weight: bold;color: #691425;margin: 1rem 0}\nul.checklist {list-style: none;margin: 1.5rem 0}\nul.checklist li {padding: 0.4rem 0;position: relative;padding-left: 1.5rem}\nul.checklist li::before {content: \"✓\";position: absolute;left: 0;color: #691425;font-weight: bold}\n.btn {display: inline-block;background-color: #691425;color: #F8F5F2;padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;text-decoration: none;font-weight: bold;border-radius: 2px}\n.btn:hover {background-color: #4A1525}\n.faq-group {margin-bottom: 2rem}\n.faq-item {background: #FFFFFF;border: 1px solid #D3B8B8;padding: 1.5rem;margin-bottom: 1rem}\n.faq-item h4 {color: #691425;margin-bottom: 0.5rem}\nfooter {background-color: #4A1525;color: #D3B8B8;text-align: center;padding: 3rem 1.5rem;font-size: 0.9rem}\nfooter a {color: #F8F5F2}\n</style><header>\n  <div>Network &amp; Flow Management</div>\n  <div>稳定、透明、高效的连接方案</div>\n</header>\n\n<div class=\"hero-band\">\n  <h1>JUST</h1>\n  <p>我们提供务实直接的流量管理与连接服务。无冗余功能，只按需提供清晰的阶梯方案与可靠的节点支持。</p>\n  <div class=\"hero-links\">\n    <a href=\"#plans\">查看方案</a>\n    <a href=\"#guide\">使用说明</a>\n    <a href=\"#faq\">常见问题</a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<main>\n\n  <section id=\"plans\">\n    <h2>服务方案</h2>\n    <p>以下为全线流量方案。阶梯式递进配置，满足不同规模的日常与工作需求。所有方案均支持按月或按年订阅。</p>\n    \n    <div>\n      <div class=\"ticket-card\">\n        <h3>基础版</h3>\n        <p>适合个人轻量日常使用与基础网页浏览。</p>\n        <div class=\"price\">¥15 <span>/月</span></div>\n        <p>按年付仅需 ¥150/年</p>\n        <ul class=\"checklist\">\n          <li>每月 100GB 极速流量</li>\n          <li>支持 3 台设备同时在线</li>\n          <li>解锁基础流媒体</li>\n          <li>普通线路节点池</li>\n        </ul>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn\">选择基础版</a>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"ticket-card featured\">\n        <div>推荐方案</div>\n        <h3>旗舰版</h3>\n        <p>全节点覆盖，兼顾高速游戏加速与全流媒体解锁。</p>\n        <div class=\"price\">¥35 <span>/月</span></div>\n        <p>按年付仅需 ¥350/年</p>\n        <ul class=\"checklist\">\n          <li>每月 300GB 极速流量</li>\n          <li>支持 5 台设备同时在线</li>\n          <li>全节点原生流媒体解锁</li>\n          <li>IPLC 专线游戏加速优化</li>\n          <li>7x24 优先工单支持</li>\n        </ul>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn\">选择旗舰版</a>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"ticket-card\">\n        <h3>团队版</h3>\n        <p>为高带宽需求与多设备协同提供的大容量专属方案。</p>\n        <div class=\"price\">¥85 <span>/月</span></div>\n        <p>按年付仅需 ¥850/年</p>\n        <ul class=\"checklist\">\n          <li>每月 1000GB 极速流量</li>\n          <li>支持 20 台设备同时在线</li>\n          <li>VIP 专属高带宽节点</li>\n          <li>支持企业定制路由</li>\n          <li>专属客户经理服务</li>\n        </ul>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn\">选择团队版</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section id=\"guide\">\n    <h2>使用说明</h2>\n    <div class=\"grid-steps\">\n      <div class=\"ticket-card\">\n        <h3>1. 选择并订阅方案</h3>\n        <p>根据您的实际流量需求挑选上方的基础版、旗舰版或团队版，完成账户开通。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ticket-card\">\n        <h3>2. 获取配置与客户端</h3>\n        <p>登录用户后台，复制专属订阅链接或下载对应操作系统的客户端应用。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ticket-card\">\n        <h3>3. 导入并连接</h3>\n        <p>将订阅地址导入客户端中，更新节点列表，选择合适线路即可开始使用。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section id=\"faq\">\n    <h2>常见问题</h2>\n\n    <div class=\"faq-group\">\n      <h3>账户与流量</h3>\n      \n      <div class=\"faq-item\">\n        <h4>流量会在什么时候重置？</h4>\n        <p>流量会在您购买当月的对应自然日进行重置，未用完的流量不会累积到下一个计费周期。</p>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"faq-item\">\n        <h4>支持随时升级或更改方案吗？</h4>\n        <p>支持。您可以在用户后台随时补差价升级到更高阶的方案，新方案权益会立即生效。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"faq-group\">\n      <h3>连接与技术</h3>\n      \n      <div class=\"faq-item\">\n        <h4>同时在线设备数量如何计算？</h4>\n        <p>同时在线设备数指在同一时间段内，使用您的订阅凭证连接到节点的客户端总数。超出限制可能会导致部分设备连接受限。</p>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"faq-item\">\n        <h4>遇到节点无法连接时该怎么办？</h4>\n        <p>请先尝试在客户端内手动更新订阅以获取最新节点列表。如问题仍未解决，可联系 7x24 工单支持获取协助。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </section>\n\n</main>\n\n<footer>\n  <p>© JUST. 保留所有权利。务实、高效、透明的网络连接服务。</p>\n  <p><a href=\"#plans\">返回顶部</a></p>\n</footer>",
